{"id":"n73270-1-5","stage":1,"title":"피다 · 开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73270-1-5-1","ko":"국화는 언제쯤 필까?","zh":"菊花大概什么时候会开啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"국화는","meaning":"菊花","explanation":"국화：菊花；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"국화","audio":"/audio/6cd1cc5d54f305fe686b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35522","senseId":"1","lemma":"국화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국화는","audio":"/audio/99f827d60ae80800649d.mp3"}},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제쯤","audio":"/audio/fd28178a926508f14a43.mp3"}},{"text":"필까?","meaning":"开","explanation":"피다：开；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"피다","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73270","senseId":"1","lemma":"피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필까","audio":"/audio/92a2cb3c21fb26e235b2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6cd1cc5d54f305fe","term":"국화","zh":"菊花","audio":"/audio/6cd1cc5d54f305fe686b.mp3","entryId":"35522","definition":"一种秋季花，花瓣主要为白色或黄色，花茎较长，香气宜人。","pronunciation":["구콰"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"aef10307b7c8f727","term":"피다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3","entryId":"73270","definition":"花骨朵或叶子等开放。","pronunciation":["피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/deedca36692e2867dc2b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73270-1-5-2","ko":"가을이 되어야 피지. 이제 여름인데 피려면 아직 멀었어.","zh":"要等到秋天才会开。现在还是夏天，要等到开花还早呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을이","audio":"/audio/9c786870b862ca6b7399.mp3"}},{"text":"되어야","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어야","audio":"/audio/ef140f8ac82d665ee110.mp3"}},{"text":"피지.","meaning":"开","explanation":"피다：开；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"피다","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73270","senseId":"1","lemma":"피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피지","audio":"/audio/84d26ed21caf657dbb70.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"여름인데","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름인데","audio":"/audio/5e7ba5b775a99e668843.mp3"}},{"text":"피려면","meaning":"开","explanation":"피다：开；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"피다","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73270","senseId":"1","lemma":"피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피려면","audio":"/audio/ffc12c69d4b58189a8a5.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"멀었어.","meaning":"还早，还不到","explanation":"멀다：还早，还不到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"4","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀었어","audio":"/audio/32b71db49a7367391ec8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"aef10307b7c8f727","term":"피다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3","entryId":"73270","definition":"花骨朵或叶子等开放。","pronunciation":["피다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"还早，还不到","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"到现在还剩较长一段时间；尚需很长时间。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e89dea4bf80cd5c0c624.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.393,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73270","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":1.9906,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"option